It is entirely possible I've messed something up somewhere, but I'm not seeing it.

Version of CakePHP from composer.json:

```
"require": {
        "php": ">=5.4.19",
        "cakephp/cakephp": "3.0.x-dev",
        "mobiledetect/mobiledetectlib": "2.*",
        "cakephp/debug_kit": "2.2.*"
    }
```

